License: UNDECIDED
 No licence is declared for this source tree, and that is deliberate rather
 than an oversight: the copyright holder is developing this browser unlicensed
 until it is complete, and will settle the terms then. Under copyright law the
 default in that situation is that no rights are granted, so packages built
 from this tree are for local use and are not distributable as they stand.
 .
 The tree carried GPL-3.0-or-later until 2026-08-31 and no longer does. Do not
 restore it, and do not add any licence here to satisfy a lint warning or to
 match a sibling project: the grant is the copyright holder's to make, and an
 absent one leaves every option open while a wrong one cannot be taken back.
 .
 Third-party components keep their own terms and are not affected by the
 above: yt-dlp, vendored at third_party/yt-dlp, is public domain (Unlicense);
 Qt is used under its LGPL-3.0-only option, linked dynamically.
